### Phase 11+: send requests from VS Code (REST Client extension: click "Send Request")
@base = http://localhost:8000
@key = dev-employee-key

### Health
GET {{base}}/health/live

### Search (evidence only)
POST {{base}}/v1/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"query": "How do I request access to the analytics workspace?", "top_k": 3}

### Answer (template)
POST {{base}}/v1/answer
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"query": "How many casual leaves do I get?"}

### Metrics (admin)
GET {{base}}/v1/metrics
X-API-Key: dev-admin-key